units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
neighbor 0.6 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes

dimension 2
region bx block -20 20 -20 20 -0.1 0.1
create_box 2 bx
fix 2d all enforce2d
create_atoms 1 random 10 29786 bx
mass 1 1
create_atoms 2 random 1 982 bx
mass 2 80

pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 0.23627 3.4056

velocity all create 300 35709 dist gaussian
timestep 1

dump img all image 100 img.*.jpg type type zoom 1.7
dump_modify img backcolor white boxcolor black
dump_modify img adiam 2 5.0
dump_modify img adiam 1 1.0

thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp pe etotal press vol

fix nve1 all nve

run 5000